// Ladder rung L3 (congruence): equality is preserved by applying the same
// operation to both sides. Lean analog: `congrArg (· + 1)`. Needs the checker
// to rewrite under an equation, not just match stored facts.

machine add_one_congruence(a: u64, b: u64)
requires
    a == b
ensures
    a + 1 == b + 1
{
